+++ b/releasenotes/notes/wait-exponential-jitter-multiplier-4d7e2a9c1b06f583.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+---
+features:
+  - |
+    Add ``multiplier`` parameter to ``wait_exponential_jitter``, with the same
+    meaning as in ``wait_exponential``. It defaults to 1.
+deprecations:
+  - |
+    The ``initial`` parameter of ``wait_exponential_jitter`` is deprecated in
+    favour of ``multiplier``. Passing ``initial`` (by keyword or positionally)
+    still works but emits a ``DeprecationWarning``. Passing both ``initial`` and
+    ``multiplier`` raises ``ValueError``.
